sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer as 买家
    actor Seller as 卖家
    actor Outsider as 第三方
    participant UI as ChatView
    participant API as ChatController
    participant Service as ChatServiceImpl
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Notify as NotificationService
    participant Push as RealtimePushService

    Buyer->>UI: 从商品进入消息页
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat/conversations
    API->>Service: createOrGetConversation
    Service->>DB: 按买家、卖家、来源查找或创建
    DB-->>Service: conversation
    Service-->>UI: 会话 ID

    Seller->>API: 对相同来源再次创建
    API->>Service: createOrGetConversation
    Service->>DB: 查询已有会话
    DB-->>Seller: 返回相同会话 ID

    Buyer->>UI: 发送消息
    UI->>API: POST /conversations/{id}/messages
    API->>Service: sendMessage
    Service->>DB: 校验参与者与双向拉黑
    Service->>DB: 写消息并更新会话
    Service->>Notify: 创建接收方通知
    Service-->>API: 已持久化消息
    API->>Push: 向双方推送 CHAT_MESSAGE
    alt 推送成功
        Push-->>Buyer: 实时事件
        Push-->>Seller: 实时事件
    else 推送异常
        API->>API: 记录告警
        API-->>Buyer: 仍返回持久化成功
    end

    Seller->>API: GET /conversations/{id}/messages
    API->>Service: listConversationMessages
    Service->>DB: 标记接收消息已读并查询历史
    DB-->>Seller: 有序消息历史

    alt 第三方访问
        Outsider->>API: 读取或发送
        API->>Service: 校验会话参与者
        Service-->>Outsider: 业务码 403
    else 任一方向拉黑
        Seller->>API: 发送消息
        Service->>DB: 检查 user_block
        Service-->>Seller: 业务码 403，不写消息
    end
